In one sentence, explain what unified memory lets a Strix Halo APU do that a 16GB discrete GPU cannot.assistant

Unified memory in the Strix Halo APU allows it to seamlessly share system memory with the GPU, enabling it to access and utilize the entire system's memory (up to 128GB or more) for graphics and compute tasks, whereas a 16GB discrete GPU is limited to its own dedicated 16GB of video memory.

